# Streamx Extractor

Kotlin library to extract YouTube video info and streams.

[![](https://jitpack.io/v/streamxap-create/Streamx-extractor.svg)](https://jitpack.io/#streamxap-create/Streamx-extractor)

## Installation

### Step 1: Add JitPack repository

Add this in your root settings.gradle.kts:

```kotlin
dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositories {
        google()
        mavenCentral()
        maven { url = uri("https://jitpack.io") }
    }
}
